{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"74f62b7c-d055-4f75-86c0-b6531f74cffa","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have written the full analysis to [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Findings\n\nWhile [`20261010040000_normal_forms.sql`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/migrations/20261010040000_normal_forms.sql) normalized parts of the schema (moving `plans.allowed_models` to `plan_models`, dropping `idea_items.person_id` and four redundant columns on `document_chunks`, converting `documents.is_public` and `drafts.tokens_in`/`tokens_out` to stored generated columns, and adding composite foreign keys and triggers), the schema is not in 3NF across four areas:\n\n1. **Unconstrained 3NF Violations (Transitive \u0026 Derived Dependencies)**:\n   * **`model_calls`** ([`20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/migrations/20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql)): `tokens_in`, `tokens_out`, and `cost_usd` are plain writable columns duplicating `usage` JSONB (`id -\u003e usage -\u003e (tokens_in, tokens_out, cost_usd)`), unlike `drafts` where they were made generated columns; `model -\u003e provider`; `item_id -\u003e project_id` (without a composite FK); `run_id -\u003e (project_id, item_id, founder_id)` via `code_questions`; and draft calls duplicate `drafts` metrics.\n   * **`code_questions`** ([`20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/migrations/20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql)): `item_id -\u003e project_id` (no composite FK); `usage -\u003e cost_usd` as a plain column; `steps`, `cost_usd`, `model`, and `usage` token totals are unguarded aggregates of `model_calls WHERE run_id = id` ([`ask_code.ts`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/functions/_shared/server/ask_code.ts#L95-L106)); and `sources[i].url` is derived from `(repo, commit_sha, path, start_line, end_line)` ([`agent.ts`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/functions/_shared/askcode/agent.ts#L121)).\n   * **`projects` GitHub board columns** ([`20261014010000_github_board_results.sql`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/migrations/20261014010000_github_board_results.sql)): `github_board_id \u003c-\u003e (github_board_owner, github_board_number) -\u003e github_board_title` are attributes of the GitHub board, not the project.\n   * **`ideas` GitHub issue \u0026 result columns** ([`20261010030000_github_app.sql`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/migrations/20261010030000_github_app.sql), [`20261014010000_github_board_results.sql`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/migrations/20261014010000_github_board_results.sql)): `(github_issue_repo, github_issue_number) -\u003e (github_issue_url, github_issue_state, github_issue_state_reason, github_issue_closed_at, github_board_status, github_checked_at, result_note_url, result_note, result_links)` — facts about the GitHub issue (which multiple ideas can link to via `comment_issue` in [`github/index.ts`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/functions/github/index.ts#L366-L383)).\n   * **`drafts`**: `text -\u003e checks` (extracted by regex in [`draft_run.ts`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/functions/_shared/core/draft_run.ts#L173)), `model -\u003e provider`, `(outcome, decided_by, decided_at) -\u003e (posted_by, posted_at)`, `sources` copying `document_chunks`/`documents` fields, `lint` derived from `text`, `meta.based_on.draft_id -\u003e version`, and `tokens.model_choice.founder_id -\u003e plan_id`.\n   * **`items`**, **`touches`**, **`voice_samples`**, **`documents` / `document_chunks`**, **`projects.landing`**, **`github_installations`**, **`identities`**, and **`accounts`**: `discovery -\u003e triage` for discovered items ([`triage_run.ts`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/functions/_shared/core/triage_run.ts#L33-L46)), `my_post` and `thread` repeating post/thread data across items, `touches` and `voice_samples` (`source = 'hearback'`) copying fields from `items`/`drafts`/`ideas`, `voice_samples` (`text -\u003e text_sha256`, `scores -\u003e (quality, status, reason)`), `documents`/`document_chunks` storing application-computed hashes/token counts and concatenated chunk text, `projects.landing` duplicating top-level `projects` columns, and `github_installations` (`account_id \u003c-\u003e account_login -\u003e account_type`).\n\n2. **2NF Violations (Partial Dependencies on Composite Keys)**:\n   * **`idea_items`**: Keyed by `(idea_id, item_id)`, but `project_id` depends on `idea_id` alone (and `item_id` alone), and `quote` depends on `item_id` alone (`firstSentence(items.text, 220)` in [`ideas.ts`](file:///tmp/h-81jlXE/supabase/functions/_shared/core/ideas.ts#L58-L68)).\n   * **`document_chunks`**: Has candidate key `(document_id, ord)`, where non-prime `project_id` (and pipeline-written `published_at`, `published_precision`, `lang`) depends on `document_id` alone.\n\n3. **Guarded 3NF Violations (Composite FKs, Triggers, Stored Generated Columns)**:\n   * Child-table copies of `project_id`, `platform`, and `person_id` on `items`, `identities`, `touches`, `document_chunks`, `idea_items`, `documents`, and `project_memory`; trigger-maintained caches (`ideas.asked_by`, `people.first_touch_at`/`last_touch_at`/`stage_changed_at`); and stored generated columns (`projects.url_key`, `documents.is_public`, `items.triage_*`, `drafts.tokens_in`/`tokens_out`).\n\n4. **1NF Violations**:\n   * Array columns (`founders.languages`, `projects.languages`/`audience`/`topics`/`competitors`, `drafts.checks`), JSONB nested relations and multi-field records (`github_installations.repos`, `projects.links`/`landing`/`settings`, `items.my_post`/`thread`/`triage`/`discovery`/`root_ref`/`parent_ref`, `drafts.sources`/`tokens`/`lint`/`meta`, `ideas.result_links`, `code_questions.sources`/`usage`, `model_calls.usage`, `voice_samples.scores`, `source_syncs.state`/`stats`, `touches.meta`, `identities.public_profile`, `accounts.settings`), and composite string columns (`source_syncs.source`, `voice_samples.external_id`, `plans.default_model`, `plan_models.model`, `founders.draft_model`, `document_chunks.embedding_model`, `github_repo`).\n","duration_seconds":656.218995,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":204735,"output_tokens":50609,"thinking_tokens":31784,"cache_read_tokens":1386744,"total_tokens":255344}}}
